            "default": 0,
            "min": 0,
            "max": 40,
            "step": 1,
            "tooltip": "Number of blocks to prefetch ahead, can speed up processing but increases memory usage. 1 is usually enough to offset speed loss from block swapping, use the debug option to confirm it for your system"
